==Russian==

===Etymology===
{{af|ru|собира́ть|-ся}}

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|собира́ться}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-собираться.ogg}}

===Verb===
{{ru-verb|собира́ться|impf|pf=собра́ться}}

# {{lb|ru|intransitive}} to [[gather]], to [[assemble]]
#: {{uxi|ru|[[люди|Лю́ди]] '''собира́ются''' [[на]] [[пло́щади]].|People '''are gathering''' in the square.}}
# to be [[go]]ing (somewhere), to be [[head]]ing ([[head off|off]]) (somewhere)
#: {{syn|ru|е́хать<q:partial>|идти́<q:partial>}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[я|Я]] '''собира́юсь''' [[в]] [[банк]].|I'm '''going to''' the bank.}}
# to be [[about to]] (do something), to be [[going to]] (do something), to [[intend]] (to do something), to [[mean]] (to do something)
#: {{uxi|ru|[[я|Я]] '''собира́юсь''' [[встре́титься]] [[с]] [[ним]].|I'm '''about''' to meet him.}}
# {{infl of|ru|собира́ть||pass}}

====Conjugation====
{{ru-conj|impf|1a|собира́ться}}

